---
description: Test and verification gates
globs: tests/**,scripts/verify*.py,scripts/beta_gate.py
alwaysApply: true
---

# Verify gates

- Run smallest scoped test first, then widen.
- No new test files without approval or TEST_ALLOWED prompt.
- Claim pass only after command exits 0.
- Do not weaken assertions or delete failing coverage to make tests pass.
- On fail: command, exit code, failed test name, traceback tail (≤80 lines) — not full logs.
